OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start to the day
OL,6,Fthen remaining cloudy with showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping through the morning. Some
OL,8,Fof these showers will become heavy
OL,9,Fwith a chance of hail and thunder in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers will continue
OL,13,Fthrough the evening, these heavy and
OL,14,Fthundery in places. These showers will
OL,15,Fslowly ease overnight but the odd one
OL,16,Fwill linger until dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
