OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy start with a few
OL,6,Fshowers, perhaps heavy in places.
OL,7,FBecoming mainly dry and bright by the
OL,8,Fafternoon but some rain will spread
OL,9,Finto the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Funsettled period with sunny spells and
OL,13,Ffurther showers, heavy at times. A
OL,14,Fspell of wet and windy weather on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
